Third-party components
======================

The TensorMark source distribution contains no third-party source code. It
builds against and depends on the following externally provided components,
each governed by its own license and obtained separately by the builder or
user:

- **pybind11** (build-time Python binding header library), used under its
  BSD-style license; fetched from PyPI as a declared build requirement.
- **NumPy** (runtime dependency), used under its BSD 3-clause license;
  fetched from PyPI as a declared dependency and not redistributed here.
- **Apple Accelerate framework** (Accelerate/AMX/NEON), used as a system
  framework on macOS at build and run time under the terms of the macOS and
  Xcode software license agreements; it is not redistributed with this
  project.
- **Clang / Apple Command Line Tools** (build toolchain) and the **Metal**
  framework where applicable, used under Apple's toolchain and system
  software license agreements.

